    <li>Fanuc robots</li>
    <li>Occasional Cognex vision systems</li>
    </ul>
  <li>Tooling
    <ul>
    <li>Troubleshooting, maintaining, cleaning, and sharpening stamping dies used to manufacture lithium thionyl chloride batteries</li>
    <li>Designing new parts to upgrade or retrofit older equipment</li>
    <li>Designing hard gauges for part or subassembly inspection</li>
    </ul>
  <li>Laser Welding
    <ul>
    <li>Weld schedule development</li>
    <li>weld cross-sectioning, preparation, and penetration measurement</li>
    <li>Nd:YAG laser maintenance and repair (LASAG)</li>
    <li>Hermeticity testing using helium mass spectrometer leak detectors</li>
    </ul>
  <li>CAD
    <ul>
    <li>Solidworks, primarily</li>
    <li>AutoCAD</li>
    <li>Autodesk Fusion/Fusion360, for home projects</li>
    <li>Autodesk Inventor, in high school, but all CAD programs are very similar</li>
    </ul> 
  <li>Python
    <ul>
    <li>Wrote scripts utilizing Pandas and MatPlotLib to filter, analyze, generate graphs, and compile results for battery runtime test data, recorded
    using an oscilloscope, and using a custom LabVIEW data acquisition system</li>
    </ul>
</ul>

